<hi rendition="#g">bu&#x0364;rgerliches Trauer&#x017F;piel</hi><lb/>
in fu&#x0364;nf Aufzu&#x0364;gen</titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline>von<lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#g">Fridrich Schiller</hi>.</docAuthor></byline><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
