kertare &#x2014;</p><lb/>
</sp><sp who="#WUR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Wurm.</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(macht fal&#x017F;che Augen)</stage> Son&#x017F;t irgend-<lb/>
