<fw type="sig" place="bottom">A 4</fw> <fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Frau.</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="8" facs="#f0012"/>
<sp who="#FMI"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Frau.</hi></speaker> <p>Nu &#x2014; Nu &#x2014; ich da&#x0364;chte nur &#x2014; ich<lb/>
