</sp><sp who="#LAD"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Lady.</hi></speaker> <p>Der Name des Herzogs &#x2014;</p><lb/>
</sp><sp who="#FER"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ferdinand.</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(hizig)</stage> Kann der Herzog Ge&#x017F;eze der<lb/>
