</sp><sp who="#LAD"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Lady.</hi></speaker> <p>Sind Sie zu Ende?</p><lb/>
</sp><sp who="#FER"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ferdinand.</hi></speaker> <p>Man ko&#x0364;nnte antworten, es i&#x017F;t<lb/>
