</sp><sp who="#GDI"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Gerichtsdiener.</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(greifen hiziger an)</stage></p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FER"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Ferdinand.</hi></speaker> <p>Wenn es denn &#x017F;eyn muß <stage>(indem er<lb/>
