<sp who="#PRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Pra&#x0364;&#x017F;ident.</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(Wie vom Bliz geru&#x0364;hrt)</stage> Was i&#x017F;t das?<lb/>
