</sp><sp who="#LAD"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Lady.</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(zer&#x017F;treut)</stage> Was &#x017F;chwazt die Na&#x0364;rrin<lb/>
da?</p><lb/>
</sp><sp who="#SOP"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Sophie.</hi></speaker> <p><stage>(boshaft)</stage> Oder es i&#x017F;t vielleicht<lb/>
